{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
JSON-LD rendered in <head> on every page (layout/theme.liquid)

- Every page: the Voxblock Organization (and WebSite on the homepage): snippet jsonld-organization.
- Product pages: the page's one Product: snippet jsonld-product.
- Articles: BlogPosting.

Everything else is rendered by sections: breadcrumbs (BreadcrumbList), faq / faq-book (FAQPage), main-collection
(CollectionPage), metaobjects-list (ItemList), video (VideoObject), microdata (metaobject pages), series-page
(BookSeries), quotes (Quotation). @id scheme (13 Oct 2026): organisation {shop}/#organization, product
{url}#product, audiobook {audiobook page}#audiobook, person {page}#person, character {page}#character, series
{page}#series, FAQ {canonical}#faq.
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- render 'jsonld-organization' -%}

{%- if request.page_type == 'product' -%}
  <script type="application/ld+json">{%- render 'jsonld-product', product: product -%}</script>
{%- elsif request.page_type == 'article' -%}
  {%- assign article_url = shop.url | append: article.url -%}
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BlogPosting",
      "@id": {{ article_url | append: '#article' | json }},
      "mainEntityOfPage": {{ article_url | json }},
      "url": {{ article_url | json }},
      "headline": {{ article.title | json }},
      "description": {{ article.excerpt_or_content | strip_html | strip_newlines | truncatewords: 25 | json }},
      "articleSection": {{ blog.title | json }},
      {%- if article.tags.size > 0 -%}
        "keywords": {{ article.tags | join: ', ' | json }},
      {%- endif -%}
      "datePublished": {{ article.published_at | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z' | json }},
      "dateModified": {{ article.updated_at | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z' | json }},
      "inLanguage": "en-GB",
      {%- if article.image != blank -%}
        "image": {{ article.image | image_url: width: 1200 | prepend: 'https:' | json }},
      {%- endif -%}
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": {{ article.author | json }}
      },
      "publisher": {%- render 'jsonld-org-ref' -%}
    }
  </script>
{%- endif -%}
